      "text": "%python\n# Paso 2: cargar solo la hoja BIL02\ndf_bil02 = pd.read_excel(ruta, sheet_name=\"BIL02\")\nprint(df_bil02)\nprint(f\"Operaciones en BIL02: {len(df_bil02)}\")",
